      "function": "explanation",
      "scene_type": "gs_section",
      "spoken": "The shape narrows as it rises and turns as it goes. According to the designers, that cuts the wind load by 24 percent compared with a rectangular tower of the same height. Inside, two glass skins wrap nine zones of atriums.",
